WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.120 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 27=

01:45.920 --> 01:48.760
(Yiyun Residence)

01:50.120 --> 01:50.760
Zhan Lu.

01:53.200 --> 01:53.800
Yes, sir.

01:53.880 --> 01:56.200
Keep an eye on Qingfeng
from Prince Wuyin's residence.

01:56.280 --> 01:58.840
Wait for the right moment
and bring him in for questioning.

01:58.920 --> 01:59.520
Qingfeng?

02:00.080 --> 02:01.840
The footprints at the crime scene match

02:02.280 --> 02:03.920
the soles of Taohua's shoes.

02:05.240 --> 02:06.360
I suspect all the attire

02:06.640 --> 02:08.320
at Prince Wuyin's residence
is custom-made.

02:08.400 --> 02:09.400
Prince Wuhen's death

02:09.680 --> 02:10.840
may be tied to Prince Wuyin.

02:11.280 --> 02:12.720
Qingfeng is Wuyin's trusted aide.

02:13.040 --> 02:14.200
We must make him talk.

02:14.400 --> 02:16.360
But footprints alone
may not be concrete enough.

02:16.840 --> 02:17.760
It's enough.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.520
Meng Huairui's matter is settled.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.120
But the fact that Mu Wuyin tried

02:21.200 --> 02:22.600
to frame Prince Wuxia,

02:23.440 --> 02:24.800
he still owes me an explanation.

02:26.360 --> 02:30.040
(Imperial Prison)

02:43.640 --> 02:44.880
The night Prince Wuhen died,

02:45.120 --> 02:46.800
someone saw you near Chunyue Pavilion.

02:47.320 --> 02:48.880
You were hiding in the shadows.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.120
When Meng Huairui left,

02:50.200 --> 02:51.360
Prince Wuhen was only injured.

02:51.440 --> 02:53.480
It was Prince Wuyin
who sent you to finish the job.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.680
Am I right?

02:55.280 --> 02:56.200
If you don't confess,

02:56.400 --> 02:57.720
can Prince Wuyin bear the crime

02:58.120 --> 02:59.440
of killing his own brother?

02:59.720 --> 03:00.560
I'm innocent.

03:00.640 --> 03:01.800
I don't know anything!

03:18.160 --> 03:19.680
Chancellor. I failed you.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.200
Qingfeng took his own life.

03:22.480 --> 03:23.560
Qingfeng is dead.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.800
Now only the heavens,

03:25.880 --> 03:27.120
you, and I know the truth.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.840
Prince Wuyin knows nothing.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.160
I'm innocent!

03:38.440 --> 03:39.400
I was framed.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.560
I didn't kill Prince Wuhen!

03:41.920 --> 03:43.240
He hit his head by accident!

03:43.680 --> 03:44.880
I swear I'm innocent!

03:48.760 --> 03:49.720
Meng Huairui.

03:54.280 --> 03:54.960
Ms. Zhenzhen.

03:56.080 --> 03:56.840
Please, I beg you!

03:57.400 --> 03:58.120
Please.

03:59.360 --> 04:00.880
I've been framed.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.520
Please help me!

04:03.040 --> 04:04.920
From now on, I'll do whatever you say.

04:05.840 --> 04:06.720
Please.

04:07.320 --> 04:08.200
I beg you.

04:10.480 --> 04:12.040
I have my parents to support.

04:12.600 --> 04:14.280
Please save me, Ms. Zhenzhen.

04:15.360 --> 04:17.120
My father is frail,
and my mother is sick.

04:17.399 --> 04:19.480
I can't let them bury their son.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.640
They're of the Meng clan.

04:22.040 --> 04:23.200
I'll take care of them.

04:23.760 --> 04:24.840
Don't worry.

04:26.000 --> 04:27.040
Thank you, Ms. Zhenzhen.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.920
Thank you, Ms. Zhenzhen.

04:40.880 --> 04:41.880
Thank you, Ms. Zhenzhen.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.240
(Huaijin,)

05:09.000 --> 05:10.320
(is the moon you watched)

05:11.040 --> 05:12.920
(as cold and distant as tonight's?)

05:13.960 --> 05:15.440
(The Meng family is a huge family.)

05:16.160 --> 05:18.200
(So huge that no number
of lives can repay its sins.)

05:18.280 --> 05:19.800
(Meng Huairui's suicide letter)

05:19.880 --> 05:20.960
(Yet, it's also so small.)

05:22.040 --> 05:23.240
(Once you were gone,)

05:24.280 --> 05:25.880
(it no longer felt like home.)

05:27.640 --> 05:28.240
(Don't worry.)

05:28.920 --> 05:31.040
(The family you gave your life
to protect,)

05:32.080 --> 05:33.680
(I'll guard it with mine.)

05:43.240 --> 05:43.880
Summon!

05:44.200 --> 05:46.160
Right Chancellor Meng requests audience!

05:48.200 --> 05:49.040
Your Majesty,

05:49.800 --> 05:51.200
I failed to discipline the young,

05:51.640 --> 05:52.320
which led

05:52.560 --> 05:54.320
to Meng Huairui daring

05:54.560 --> 05:56.360
to purchase the exam topic.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.360
Please punish me,

05:58.200 --> 05:58.880
Your Majesty.

06:12.720 --> 06:13.760
I am willing

06:15.080 --> 06:17.160
to resign from overseeing
the imperial exam,

06:18.160 --> 06:19.960
return home,

06:21.320 --> 06:22.560
and live out my days teaching

06:22.840 --> 06:24.040
and serving the people.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.280
I ask

06:26.000 --> 06:27.600
that Your Majesty would grant this.

06:51.160 --> 06:52.880
When Huaijin made his mistake,

06:53.560 --> 06:54.920
you said the same thing.

06:56.000 --> 06:58.200
Stepping down twice in one year?

07:02.840 --> 07:04.280
It seems that the official seal

07:06.600 --> 07:08.600
is too heavy for you.

07:22.720 --> 07:23.600
The Meng clan

07:24.480 --> 07:26.680
is Qi's top noble house.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.280
With so many descendants,

07:29.560 --> 07:31.720
a few unworthy ones are inevitable.

07:32.480 --> 07:34.200
I'm getting old.

07:35.000 --> 07:37.040
State affairs tire me.

07:37.600 --> 07:40.120
I admit I can't manage it all.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.120
Indeed.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.240
The Meng family truly

07:50.800 --> 07:52.880
is the top noble family in Qi.

07:53.200 --> 07:55.080
Your students are spread
throughout the court.

07:55.520 --> 07:56.920
No official rises

07:57.240 --> 07:59.480
without passing through the Meng's gate.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.120
After a hundred years,

08:01.200 --> 08:02.480
even the appointment of rulers

08:02.800 --> 08:04.840
is subject to the Meng's will.

08:06.440 --> 08:08.080
I would never dare.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.960
It doesn't make any difference

08:14.320 --> 08:15.480
to you whether you resign

08:15.920 --> 08:17.040
from your post.

08:17.680 --> 08:19.040
But have you thought about this?

08:19.800 --> 08:22.440
If the Meng family is no longer
the top noble family,

08:23.080 --> 08:25.080
will the Qin and Duan families

08:25.200 --> 08:27.560
let you retire in peace?

08:27.760 --> 08:29.760
Or will they take the chance

08:29.840 --> 08:32.520
to crush the Mengs
and never let you rise again?

08:37.880 --> 08:38.720
Meng Zhongyan.

08:41.679 --> 08:43.120
You can keep the Chancellor's seal

08:44.640 --> 08:46.280
or leave it.

08:47.840 --> 08:48.560
It's up to you.

08:53.600 --> 08:57.560
(Shen Residence)

09:00.520 --> 09:01.440
Shen Zaiye!

09:01.960 --> 09:03.040
In broad daylight,

09:03.360 --> 09:05.280
you dare arrest my man?

09:07.480 --> 09:08.840
Prince Wuyin, calm down.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.800
The night Prince Wuhen died,

09:11.120 --> 09:13.400
Qingfeng was spotted
at Chunyue Pavilion.

09:13.800 --> 09:15.160
His footprints were also found

09:15.680 --> 09:16.920
at the scene.

09:19.640 --> 09:20.360
Prince Wuhen,

09:20.560 --> 09:22.360
I only came to purchase a jade pendant.

09:23.880 --> 09:24.480
Get lost!

09:25.280 --> 09:27.120
I know that jade pendant
is the exam topic,

09:27.200 --> 09:29.320
and I know you've already sold it
to more than a few.

09:29.560 --> 09:30.160
You…

09:31.080 --> 09:32.880
You will sell it even
if you don't want to!

09:33.000 --> 09:34.800
Let's see what you can bargain with now!

10:08.320 --> 10:10.200
The footprints in the room

10:10.760 --> 10:12.080
match Qingfeng's.

10:13.640 --> 10:15.280
But rest assured, Your Highness.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.800
Since Qingfeng was your trusted aide,

10:18.120 --> 10:20.520
I'll treat him accordingly.

10:22.160 --> 10:23.280
"Accordingly"?

10:25.040 --> 10:26.320
You tortured him, didn't you?

10:28.320 --> 10:28.920
Yes, I did.

10:31.880 --> 10:34.760
It turns out Qingfeng knew a lot.

10:37.400 --> 10:38.720
You forced a confession.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.760
Whether it was or not,

10:43.240 --> 10:44.800
that's not for you or me to say.

10:45.760 --> 10:47.160
His Majesty will decide.

10:48.960 --> 10:50.240
Since the Heir fell from favor,

10:50.680 --> 10:53.040
His Majesty only has three sons left.

10:54.280 --> 10:55.440
If His Majesty finds out

10:55.840 --> 10:57.440
that you killed Prince Wuhen

10:57.520 --> 10:58.880
and tried to frame Prince Wuxia,

10:59.240 --> 11:00.000
I wonder

11:00.280 --> 11:01.360
how disappointed he'll be.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.360
Are you really going back on your word

11:04.160 --> 11:05.720
and letting Jiang Taohua die?

11:08.840 --> 11:10.280
I did promise the Meng family

11:10.720 --> 11:11.880
I would drop the case.

11:13.600 --> 11:15.040
But you and I

11:15.520 --> 11:16.680
never made any deal yet.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.440
What else do you want?

11:21.400 --> 11:24.840
I want you to voluntarily withdraw
from overseeing the Imperial Exam.

11:26.720 --> 11:28.120
I thought

11:28.360 --> 11:29.920
you'd keep pushing for the antidote.

11:30.800 --> 11:32.080
Do you even have something

11:32.640 --> 11:33.360
that valuable?

11:36.920 --> 11:39.600
Which is
why I'm asking you to do something

11:39.840 --> 11:41.360
within your reach.

11:56.080 --> 11:56.680
Wen Jin,

11:57.840 --> 12:00.000
take this token and release Wuxia
from house arrest.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.040
Restore his position

12:01.120 --> 12:02.640
and reinstate him as chief examiner.

12:05.840 --> 12:06.560
Your Majesty,

12:06.680 --> 12:09.440
you had Prince Wuyin step in
for Prince Wuxia before.

12:09.760 --> 12:12.240
Will there now be two chief examiners?

12:15.360 --> 12:16.640
Ah, I've forgotten about that.

12:18.400 --> 12:20.120
Two chief examiners
for one Imperial Exam.

12:20.360 --> 12:23.640
It would be a headache
when the top scholar picks a mentor.

12:24.960 --> 12:26.080
No need to worry, Father.

12:26.680 --> 12:27.360
I'm willing

12:27.880 --> 12:29.440
to step down from this appointment.

12:30.200 --> 12:30.880
Step down?

12:32.600 --> 12:34.000
This role is something

12:34.080 --> 12:35.560
many would dream of.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.040
Why give it up?

12:37.160 --> 12:37.760
Father,

12:38.680 --> 12:39.960
I merely stepped in to help

12:40.560 --> 12:42.880
when things were in chaos.

12:43.840 --> 12:44.880
Besides, you know

12:45.320 --> 12:46.480
my heart is not in this.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.560
Besides,

12:48.760 --> 12:50.840
Wuxia surpasses me

12:51.960 --> 12:53.240
in both learning and ability.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.760
He's also well-respected

12:56.320 --> 12:57.440
among the scholars.

12:58.440 --> 12:59.920
So it's only right

13:00.440 --> 13:01.760
he takes the post again.

13:05.400 --> 13:07.080
You've truly grasped the scholar's path.

13:07.560 --> 13:09.000
You're free from worldly ambition.

13:09.360 --> 13:10.800
That pleases me.

13:12.400 --> 13:13.440
You flatter me, Father.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.640
I'll take my leave now.

13:23.960 --> 13:24.680
Prince Wuyin,

13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
Qingfeng's body has been sent back

13:26.920 --> 13:28.160
to your residence.

13:29.560 --> 13:31.760
The Chancellor selected
the finest coffin for him.

13:33.680 --> 13:35.920
He also asked me
to offer his condolences.

13:36.400 --> 13:37.200
He deeply regrets

13:37.680 --> 13:38.880
Qingfeng's passing.

13:46.120 --> 13:47.160
(Shen Zaiye,)

13:47.840 --> 13:49.400
(you blocked my path today.)

13:49.840 --> 13:50.600
(One day,)

13:51.040 --> 13:53.720
(I'll make that path
the very steps you kneel on.)

13:55.960 --> 13:59.720
(Shunjing Residence)

14:07.680 --> 14:08.720
(This is for you.)

14:15.640 --> 14:17.440
(Qingtai has left Qi for a month now.)

14:17.800 --> 14:18.760
(I wonder)

14:18.840 --> 14:20.880
(if she has reached there safely.)

14:21.320 --> 14:22.520
(Has she found Changjue?)

14:23.400 --> 14:24.200
(How is)

14:25.120 --> 14:26.040
(he doing now?)

14:27.280 --> 14:30.960
(Deep within the Suwu Desert)

14:54.920 --> 14:57.240
Excuse me.
How far is it to Xingzhou, Beiyuan?

14:57.920 --> 14:59.600
Not far. Just past the desert.

15:00.720 --> 15:03.200
Are there
any Beiyuan military camps nearby?

15:03.400 --> 15:04.080
I don't know.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.120
(Don't worry, Princess.)

15:41.800 --> 15:43.480
(I'll find Prince Changjue
no matter what.)

16:00.160 --> 16:01.400
(If I stay idle too long)

16:01.960 --> 16:03.080
(and anything happens,)

16:03.720 --> 16:06.240
(I could be a burden
to Qingtai and Changjue.)

16:07.400 --> 16:09.160
(If I can uncover
Empress Lv's background,)

16:09.960 --> 16:11.640
(perhaps I can turn the game
in our favor.)

16:13.320 --> 16:14.640
(I'm alone now.)

16:15.520 --> 16:17.160
(I need an ally.)

16:18.800 --> 16:25.320
(Examination Hall)

16:46.400 --> 16:48.040
What are you doing here,
Chancellor Shen?

16:49.680 --> 16:50.680
The exam is near.

16:50.760 --> 16:52.920
If I don't get things in order now,
it'll be too late.

16:54.080 --> 16:55.720
As an exam supervisor,

16:56.000 --> 16:57.080
cleaning the site myself

16:57.320 --> 16:59.200
also ensures no one hides
anything suspicious.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.200
Thank you for saving my life,

17:08.040 --> 17:09.119
Chancellor Shen.

17:40.360 --> 17:41.160
Mu Wuxia,

17:41.480 --> 17:43.120
don't just thank him.

17:43.720 --> 17:45.920
She is the one
you should really be grateful to.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.280
Greetings, Prince Wuxia.

17:52.040 --> 17:53.320
I'm glad

17:53.520 --> 17:54.400
to see you safe.

17:56.640 --> 17:57.520
Princess Chengping?

17:58.560 --> 17:59.160
You're…

17:59.680 --> 18:00.640
You're alive.

18:03.280 --> 18:04.480
Of course, she's alive.

18:04.560 --> 18:06.000
She's the real deal. No fakes here.

18:06.160 --> 18:06.760
But

18:06.920 --> 18:08.840
where have you been all this time?

18:10.880 --> 18:11.800
It's a long story.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.560
Stop asking her so many questions.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.480
She still doesn't remember everything.

18:17.920 --> 18:19.320
Don't we have things to do?

18:20.160 --> 18:20.880
Let's get going.

18:21.560 --> 18:23.120
Jiang Taohua, lend my brother a hand.

18:31.600 --> 18:32.720
After you returned that day,

18:33.320 --> 18:34.480
did you feel better?

18:35.440 --> 18:36.200
I'm fine now.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.520
Thank you for your concern.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.360
That's good to hear.

18:47.680 --> 18:48.720
There's something

18:49.560 --> 18:51.360
I'd like you to help with.

18:52.040 --> 18:52.720
What is it?

18:53.480 --> 18:55.040
I overheard Prince Wuyin call Empress Lv

18:55.120 --> 18:56.320
by the name Hua.

18:56.920 --> 18:59.880
He seems to treasure her bracelet
like it's sacred.

19:00.480 --> 19:01.960
I just can't figure out

19:02.160 --> 19:03.200
their relationship.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.480
To my knowledge,

19:07.720 --> 19:09.240
Prince Wuyin has never left Qi.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.480
After his coming-of-age ceremony,

19:11.560 --> 19:13.360
he moved straight
into Shunjing Residence.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.680
I've never heard
of any women living there.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.040
When I was little,

19:18.200 --> 19:19.840
Empress Lv was already in Beiyuan Palace

19:19.920 --> 19:21.320
and holding power over the court.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.560
Since then,

19:22.640 --> 19:24.520
I doubt she's had any opportunity
to come to Qi.

19:24.600 --> 19:25.840
Let alone meet Prince Wuyin.

19:28.760 --> 19:31.200
I had her background investigated.

19:32.080 --> 19:33.440
Before she entered Beiyuan Palace,

19:33.520 --> 19:35.000
her identity was shrouded in mystery.

19:35.080 --> 19:36.480
Almost as if it were fabricated.

19:37.120 --> 19:38.200
So I suspect

19:38.280 --> 19:40.240
Empress Lv may have once lived
in the Qi Palace.

19:43.840 --> 19:44.720
I'll be staying here

19:45.000 --> 19:46.040
during the exam period.

19:46.280 --> 19:48.440
But I'll have a trusted aide
continue investigating.

19:48.520 --> 19:49.480
So you can rest easy.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.040
No rush.

19:51.280 --> 19:52.520
I appreciate your help.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.200
I'll find a way to contact you

19:54.600 --> 19:56.040
after the exams are over.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.120
I should go.

20:17.880 --> 20:19.600
What's going on between those two?

20:19.840 --> 20:20.520
Confucius said,

20:20.600 --> 20:23.280
"Don't look at what's improper,
don't listen to what's improper."

20:24.120 --> 20:26.520
After all the trouble
my brother went through to rescue you,

20:26.600 --> 20:28.400
shouldn't you be thinking
of how to repay him?

20:28.480 --> 20:29.840
Do you even have a conscience?

20:34.120 --> 20:35.560
Doing my part right now

20:37.760 --> 20:39.400
is the best way I can repay him.

20:42.760 --> 20:44.720
(Shen Residence)

20:44.800 --> 20:45.520
Chancellor.

20:48.280 --> 20:50.920
Chancellor. Imperial Physician Bai
has made a major discovery.

20:51.840 --> 20:52.680
Prepare the horse.

20:56.520 --> 20:57.560
Imperial Physician Bai.

20:59.600 --> 21:00.280
Chancellor.

21:01.920 --> 21:04.240
The antidote you gave me
for the Jiangtao Pill

21:04.400 --> 21:05.880
contains a deadly poison,

21:06.200 --> 21:08.040
which is extremely rare and aggressive.

21:08.280 --> 21:09.200
The monthly dose

21:09.400 --> 21:11.680
is actually used
to fight poison with poison

21:11.880 --> 21:14.480
to suppress the Jiangtao Pill.

21:14.880 --> 21:15.760
In my opinion,

21:15.840 --> 21:17.480
using acupuncture to draw out the poison

21:17.560 --> 21:19.320
might be another way.

21:21.080 --> 21:21.680
All right.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.240
All right.

21:27.360 --> 21:30.720
(Yujing)

21:30.800 --> 21:32.640
Before anyone enters
the Examination Hall,

21:33.280 --> 21:34.720
you will be thoroughly searched

21:34.920 --> 21:35.960
from the top of the head

21:36.120 --> 21:37.200
to the soles of the feet.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.800
There must

21:39.320 --> 21:41.480
be no cheating this time.

21:41.880 --> 21:43.000
If any of you discover

21:43.200 --> 21:44.720
bribery or misconduct,

21:45.360 --> 21:46.920
report it to me directly.

21:47.120 --> 21:48.720
I've obtained imperial permission

21:49.280 --> 21:50.440
that anyone caught cheating

21:50.760 --> 21:52.000
will be executed on the spot.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.720
That's great.

21:53.880 --> 21:54.920
That's how it should be.

21:55.600 --> 21:58.520
You've all likely heard

21:59.240 --> 22:00.880
about the exam leak earlier.

22:01.680 --> 22:03.400
To prevent it from happening again,

22:04.160 --> 22:06.000
I've requested special orders
from His Majesty.

22:06.320 --> 22:09.800
I will personally set the topic
on the spot this time.

22:10.360 --> 22:11.440
Long live our wise ruler.

22:11.760 --> 22:13.760
Prince Wuxia,
you're meticulous in your judgment.

22:14.640 --> 22:16.920
- Long live our wise ruler!
- Long live our wise ruler!

22:26.080 --> 22:28.320
Examinees, enter the hall!

22:38.600 --> 22:39.920
(These humble scholars)

22:40.560 --> 22:42.080
(are Qi's future.)

22:43.160 --> 22:43.880
(There will be)

22:43.960 --> 22:46.000
(no more tragedies like Jiaohan's.)

22:47.320 --> 22:50.000
(The just world
that Mr. Nobody dreamed of)

22:50.480 --> 22:51.480
(will come.)

23:05.960 --> 23:07.160
You treat him as a brother.

23:07.600 --> 23:09.200
But has he ever treated you the same?

23:09.800 --> 23:11.960
He's never shown any special affection.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.720
But he's never been unkind either.

23:15.360 --> 23:16.400
He was being courteous.

23:16.480 --> 23:17.600
You actually believe that?

23:18.520 --> 23:19.680
What are you, a child?

23:31.920 --> 23:32.960
You're not young anymore.

23:33.040 --> 23:34.600
You should know how the world works.

23:35.320 --> 23:36.640
In a power struggle like this,

23:37.200 --> 23:38.440
it doesn't end

23:38.520 --> 23:39.520
until one side falls.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.640
If you don't strike first,

23:42.720 --> 23:44.120
you'll always be at their mercy.

23:48.840 --> 23:49.640
(Hua,)

23:50.120 --> 23:51.320
(I'll do as you say.)

23:51.520 --> 23:53.760
(I won't disappoint you this time.)

23:55.720 --> 23:56.800
Return to the residence.

24:07.920 --> 24:08.640
(Father,)

24:09.120 --> 24:11.280
(the Examination Hall
you fought so hard to protect)

24:11.680 --> 24:13.040
(is finally bearing fruit.)

24:13.120 --> 24:14.440
(Memorial Tablet of Xie Guanyu)

24:14.520 --> 24:16.240
(From now on,
even the humblest scholars)

24:16.320 --> 24:17.760
(will have a place in court.)

24:17.840 --> 24:20.040
(The monopoly of the noble clans
will come to an end.)

24:20.120 --> 24:21.720
(Xie)

24:21.800 --> 24:22.680
(I've fulfilled)

24:23.560 --> 24:24.760
(your wish.)

24:26.040 --> 24:27.080
(And one day,)

24:27.800 --> 24:29.840
(I'll clear the name
of the entire Xie clan.)

24:31.040 --> 24:32.040
(You can rest in peace.)

24:32.120 --> 24:34.000
(Xie Clan Memorial Tablets)

24:40.600 --> 24:45.800
(Examination Hall)

25:26.480 --> 25:27.160
Chancellor Shen.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.960
The Examination Hall
is under lockdown for grading.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.920
Who dares to cause a disturbance?

25:43.120 --> 25:44.000
Leave immediately!

25:44.280 --> 25:45.240
Zhan Lu,

25:45.320 --> 25:46.200
you've got some nerve!

25:46.880 --> 25:48.960
I played this piece for Mu Wuxia!

25:49.040 --> 25:50.280
You don't deserve to hear it!

25:50.600 --> 25:51.400
Cover your ears!

26:07.480 --> 26:08.200
Miss Qingying.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.120
Miss Qingying.

26:15.080 --> 26:15.880
Miss Qingying,

26:16.560 --> 26:17.920
this is the grading period.

26:18.240 --> 26:19.640
Don't you think playing music here

26:20.000 --> 26:21.200
is inappropriate?

26:22.400 --> 26:23.680
But I wanted to see you,

26:24.080 --> 26:25.360
and you won't let me in.

26:25.560 --> 26:27.000
I know how hard you've been working.

26:27.080 --> 26:28.040
This is my only way

26:28.120 --> 26:29.360
to help you relax!

26:32.760 --> 26:33.360
Still,

26:33.680 --> 26:34.840
you will disturb the others

26:35.280 --> 26:36.600
by playing out here.

26:41.800 --> 26:42.600
Fine, I'll leave.

26:43.880 --> 26:44.680
Wait.

26:48.160 --> 26:48.920
How about this?

26:49.520 --> 26:51.880
Let's play a piece together.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.000
What do you think?

26:53.480 --> 26:54.600
You play the qin too?

26:55.640 --> 26:56.560
All right.

26:56.880 --> 26:58.960
Let's play a duet then.

28:11.000 --> 28:11.640
Chancellor,

28:12.000 --> 28:13.640
I found something about the person

28:13.760 --> 28:14.920
you asked me to investigate.

28:15.800 --> 28:16.920
She's from the palace?

28:17.120 --> 28:19.520
Yes. When Prince Wuyin
was a child in the palace,

28:19.640 --> 28:22.040
there was a maid named Hua.

28:22.680 --> 28:23.280
Back then,

28:23.360 --> 28:25.240
Prince Wuyin's sister,

28:25.320 --> 28:27.160
Princess Jinrong, suddenly passed away.

28:27.800 --> 28:28.840
He won't let anyone

28:28.920 --> 28:30.280
get close to him.

28:31.560 --> 28:33.000
Only Hua

28:33.520 --> 28:35.000
was different from the rest.

28:37.200 --> 28:39.320
Get out! All of you!

28:46.480 --> 28:47.760
Why are you still here?

28:48.120 --> 28:48.920
Your Highness,

28:49.160 --> 28:51.320
my duty is to care for you.

28:51.560 --> 28:53.800
Usually, it was my elder sister
who looked after me.

28:54.160 --> 28:55.240
What's your name?

28:55.520 --> 28:56.680
My name is Hua.

28:57.640 --> 28:59.960
That palace maid,
Hua, must've had some skill.

29:00.160 --> 29:02.400
She had Prince Wuyin wrapped
around her little finger.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.680
But one day,

29:04.960 --> 29:07.240
she just vanished for no reason.

29:11.080 --> 29:12.800
There's something else strange.

29:13.520 --> 29:16.760
When I went to the Imperial Clan Court
to check the records,

29:17.040 --> 29:19.000
the records on Hua

29:19.160 --> 29:20.320
are all missing.

29:23.840 --> 29:24.720
Thank you, Eunuch Wen.

29:34.840 --> 29:38.680
(Shunjing Residence)

29:38.760 --> 29:40.280
Shen Zaiye, huh?

29:40.400 --> 29:41.760
(Daily Record of Prince Mu Wuyin)

29:41.840 --> 29:43.640
You've reached much farther
than you should.

29:44.360 --> 29:46.840
Who leaked Hua's existence?

29:47.360 --> 29:49.520
Your Highness,
I've served you for years.

29:49.760 --> 29:51.000
I've never once betrayed you.

29:51.320 --> 29:52.440
Heaven and earth can attest!

29:58.360 --> 30:00.680
These are my memories with Hua.

30:01.800 --> 30:03.680
I've kept them for years.

30:38.280 --> 30:40.560
How did Shen Zaiye find out?

30:41.560 --> 30:43.800
Could Qingfeng have said
something before he died?

30:44.560 --> 30:47.680
If he had said something
about it before he died,

30:49.080 --> 30:50.400
Shen Zaiye wouldn't have let me off

30:50.480 --> 30:52.600
with just quitting the exams.

30:54.600 --> 30:55.280
Your Highness,

30:56.040 --> 30:58.520
remember that fire
in the side courtyard?

30:59.320 --> 31:00.680
Shen Zaiye arrived unusually fast,

31:01.240 --> 31:03.000
and Jiang Taohua never returned
that night.

31:03.600 --> 31:04.440
Could

31:05.400 --> 31:06.920
she know something?

31:11.280 --> 31:12.400
Jiang Taohua.

31:16.560 --> 31:17.920
If I hadn't needed her

31:18.760 --> 31:21.600
to keep Shen Zaiye in check,

31:22.280 --> 31:24.080
I would've let the poison take her
long ago.

31:24.640 --> 31:25.880
Bring her to me.

31:26.360 --> 31:27.200
Yes, Your Highness.

31:46.320 --> 31:47.760
Greetings, Your Highness.

31:49.240 --> 31:50.240
Miss Meng,

31:50.520 --> 31:51.680
it's only been a few days.

31:52.360 --> 31:53.400
You look well.

31:54.200 --> 31:55.520
Thanks to your care,

31:55.640 --> 31:57.720
the servants have treated me kindly.

31:58.680 --> 32:00.800
That's the problem.
They've been too kind

32:01.400 --> 32:03.040
and have let you wander

32:03.120 --> 32:04.160
wherever you please.

32:04.440 --> 32:06.320
So now you know things

32:06.400 --> 32:07.480
you shouldn't.

32:07.880 --> 32:09.400
And worse, you're remembering things

32:09.480 --> 32:10.560
you shouldn't!

32:12.720 --> 32:14.040
Your Highness, what do you mean?

32:14.600 --> 32:15.720
My brother's and my life

32:15.800 --> 32:16.920
are in your hands.

32:17.400 --> 32:18.720
Even if I did recall something,

32:19.240 --> 32:20.760
I would never betray you.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.680
You have such a lovely face.

32:28.560 --> 32:30.000
I can't help but feel sorry for it.

32:31.200 --> 32:33.280
If I carved a few lines

32:33.800 --> 32:35.160
and disfigured you,

32:36.360 --> 32:38.560
would Shen Zaiye still love you
and protect you?

32:38.960 --> 32:40.040
What Shen Zaiye thinks

32:40.360 --> 32:41.440
has nothing to do with me.

32:42.680 --> 32:43.680
All I ask is

32:44.240 --> 32:45.480
that you let me and Changjue

32:46.080 --> 32:47.360
live in peace.

32:53.000 --> 32:54.320
If you want to survive,

32:55.440 --> 32:57.200
you'd better make yourself useful

32:58.040 --> 32:59.520
and keep Shen Zaiye in check.

33:00.760 --> 33:01.560
Yes, Your Highness.

33:02.560 --> 33:03.520
I'll do it at once.

33:15.240 --> 33:15.840
Your Highness,

33:17.040 --> 33:18.040
do you really trust her?

33:20.960 --> 33:22.440
As long as we have the antidote

33:22.520 --> 33:24.280
and Jiang Changjue in our hands,

33:25.920 --> 33:28.480
Jiang Taohua won't be able
to stir up anything.

33:30.720 --> 33:33.360
She'll always be Shen Zaiye's weakness.

33:36.800 --> 33:39.160
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

33:39.240 --> 33:40.480
To avoid alarming anyone,

33:40.680 --> 33:42.040
you must stop investigating.

33:43.520 --> 33:44.760
Did Prince Wuyin suspect you?

33:46.160 --> 33:47.120
Prince Wuyin

33:47.920 --> 33:49.240
trusts me completely now.

33:56.080 --> 33:56.680
By the way,

33:58.680 --> 34:00.880
did you receive
any letters from Qingtai?

34:02.040 --> 34:02.720
Qingtai?

34:03.240 --> 34:05.000
Didn't she go to Beiyuan
to find her family?

34:05.080 --> 34:07.280
Why would she send letters
to the Chancellor's residence?

34:07.360 --> 34:08.480
If she were to write to me,

34:08.760 --> 34:10.639
this is the only place
she could send them.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.520
She has been gone for over a month.

34:14.000 --> 34:15.480
But there's still no word from her.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.159
I can receive her letters for you.

34:18.520 --> 34:20.080
But only if you answer one question.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.560
What is it?

34:21.920 --> 34:23.880
Why did you send Qingtai to Beiyuan?

34:24.560 --> 34:26.120
If it's something dangerous,

34:26.320 --> 34:27.719
I don't mind getting dragged in.

34:28.000 --> 34:29.920
But I'd still like to be prepared.

34:31.480 --> 34:33.960
I only asked her to find Changjue

34:34.040 --> 34:35.560
in Xingzhou, Beiyuan, nothing more.

34:35.800 --> 34:37.040
Don't worry, Chancellor.

34:37.440 --> 34:38.400
And once she finds him?

34:39.880 --> 34:40.520
I don't think

34:41.560 --> 34:43.159
that is your concern, right?

34:47.159 --> 34:48.239
Speaking of Changjue,

34:49.199 --> 34:50.199
I found a letter

34:50.400 --> 34:51.600
he once wrote to you.

34:51.719 --> 34:53.120
I put it back where I found it.

35:02.640 --> 35:04.440
Do you remember the secret compartment?

35:07.560 --> 35:08.440
It's Qingtai.

35:09.520 --> 35:10.880
Qingtai once told me about it.

35:16.960 --> 35:18.440
If you're set on finding Changjue,

35:18.760 --> 35:19.360
perhaps

35:20.000 --> 35:21.480
I can help you soon.

35:22.560 --> 35:25.960
Imperial Physician Bai is working on
a permanent cure for the Jiangtao Pill.

35:26.240 --> 35:27.160
Once it's complete,

35:27.520 --> 35:29.360
you'll be free of it for good.

35:31.080 --> 35:32.280
Thank you for your help.

35:32.920 --> 35:34.240
How do you plan to repay me?

35:37.400 --> 35:38.240
You're

35:38.560 --> 35:39.640
Left Chancellor.

35:40.960 --> 35:42.840
You already have wealth, status,
and power.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.240
What could I possibly give you?

35:45.000 --> 35:45.920
How about

35:46.560 --> 35:48.320
a simple meal with me?

35:49.720 --> 35:50.640
What do you mean?

35:52.240 --> 35:53.000
Nothing.

35:54.240 --> 35:55.600
I just realized

35:56.240 --> 35:57.480
we've never sat down for a meal

35:57.560 --> 35:58.880
without hidden agendas.

36:06.760 --> 36:07.400
Zhan Lu.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.160
Yes, Chancellor.

36:09.600 --> 36:11.480
Tell the kitchen
to prepare some ingredients.

36:12.800 --> 36:13.560
Shrimps too.

36:16.720 --> 36:18.520
Do you want them steamed
or sweet-and-sour?

36:18.600 --> 36:19.280
I'll inform them…

36:19.360 --> 36:20.240
I'll cook it myself.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.080
Yes, sir.

36:34.800 --> 36:35.960
Since you made them for me,

36:37.680 --> 36:38.920
then I'll savor every bite.

36:49.720 --> 36:51.480
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

37:00.120 --> 37:01.440
Would you like to cook with me?

37:02.400 --> 37:03.800
- We once…
- Chancellor Shen,

37:03.920 --> 37:05.720
I can't stand the smell
of oil and smoke.

37:10.320 --> 37:11.000
Very well.

37:11.760 --> 37:12.880
Then wait here for me.

37:39.240 --> 37:41.080
(This tree has deep roots
and lush leaves.)

37:41.680 --> 37:42.920
(It blossoms year after year.)

37:44.320 --> 37:45.640
(But when the storm hits,)

37:46.400 --> 37:47.400
(the tree remains,)

37:48.000 --> 37:49.280
(yet the flowers are gone.)

37:50.840 --> 37:51.800
(So,)

37:52.480 --> 37:53.680
(why cling to foolish hopes?)

37:54.760 --> 37:56.280
(Pushing you out of this game)

37:56.880 --> 37:58.920
(is the least I can do
for all you've done for me.)

37:59.000 --> 38:05.200
♪I'd be a chess piece to chase a dream
through peril and wonder♪

38:07.040 --> 38:14.040
♪I'd burn myself
without regret for freedom♪

38:15.800 --> 38:22.800
♪All I long for is you by my side,
as we watch time's tenderness unfold♪

38:24.640 --> 38:31.640
♪I sketch and paint the sky
and your silhouette♪

38:33.080 --> 38:40.080
♪I carve as a sharp knife,
with no answers for morality♪

38:41.960 --> 38:46.280
♪Even if it's nothing but an illusion♪

38:48.160 --> 38:48.760
Zhan Lu,

38:49.440 --> 38:51.880
head to Xingzhou, Beiyuan,
to find Qingtai and Changjue.

38:52.640 --> 38:53.400
Qingtai

38:53.600 --> 38:54.680
is in Xingzhou, Beiyuan?

38:55.360 --> 38:57.120
Taohua sent her to look for Changjue.

38:57.760 --> 38:58.600
The two of them

38:59.160 --> 39:00.440
mean a great deal to her.

39:00.800 --> 39:02.440
Nothing must happen to either of them.

39:04.880 --> 39:05.840
But Chancellor,

39:06.040 --> 39:07.800
you've done so much
for the Princess already.

39:07.880 --> 39:09.600
There's no guarantee she'll be grateful.

39:12.000 --> 39:13.200
I don't need her gratitude.

39:14.360 --> 39:15.360
I'll depart immediately.

39:24.880 --> 39:25.920
Imperial Physician Bai,

39:26.640 --> 39:27.440
any progress?

39:27.840 --> 39:28.440
Chancellor,

39:28.640 --> 39:30.960
I used acupuncture
to release the poisoned blood

39:31.040 --> 39:33.000
and supplemented it
with qi-enhancing medicine.

39:33.280 --> 39:36.040
One of the test subjects
has survived for over a month.

39:36.600 --> 39:37.800
Where is he? Take me to him.

39:38.200 --> 39:38.880
Please follow me.

39:45.840 --> 39:46.880
All poisons

39:46.960 --> 39:48.480
depend on the dose.

39:48.560 --> 39:51.000
With proper control,
they can even help restore one's qi.

39:57.720 --> 39:59.560
It seems this bloodletting method

39:59.640 --> 40:02.440
can only buy time
before the poison takes effect.

40:03.240 --> 40:06.440
To find the cure
for the Jiangtao Pill's poison,

40:06.720 --> 40:08.080
I will need to try other methods.

40:15.000 --> 40:16.520
Imperial Physician Bai is working on

40:16.600 --> 40:18.160
a permanent cure for the Jiangtao Pill.

40:18.240 --> 40:19.080
Once it's complete,

40:19.600 --> 40:21.240
you'll be free of it for good.

40:24.520 --> 40:25.760
(I can't give her hope)

40:26.480 --> 40:27.600
(only to crush it again.)

40:36.080 --> 40:36.960
Well done.

40:37.480 --> 40:40.720
He's clearly a promising talent.

40:47.880 --> 40:49.320
What can I do for you, Chancellor?

40:50.640 --> 40:53.640
The imperial exams are now awaiting
the final decree from His Majesty.

40:53.760 --> 40:54.880
Once the results are posted,

40:54.960 --> 40:56.280
I intend to travel to Beiyuan.

40:57.480 --> 40:58.440
To Beiyuan?

40:58.520 --> 40:59.720
That round trip

40:59.840 --> 41:00.880
will take quite some time.

41:00.960 --> 41:01.920
What about your duties?

41:02.040 --> 41:03.760
I've requested leave from His Majesty.

41:04.240 --> 41:06.040
The Imperial Secretariat
will handle them.

41:06.800 --> 41:09.280
You've served the court for years
and never once taken leave.

41:09.960 --> 41:10.560
Are you going

41:10.640 --> 41:12.280
to find Princess Chengping's medicine?

41:13.600 --> 41:15.360
But I also want
to investigate Empress Lv.

41:15.560 --> 41:17.880
I suspect everything
that had happened around the exams

41:18.040 --> 41:18.960
is tied to her.

41:20.240 --> 41:21.240
With her temperament,

41:21.640 --> 41:23.160
she won't let such a defeat

41:23.600 --> 41:24.800
go unanswered.

41:25.600 --> 41:26.760
While I'm away,

41:27.120 --> 41:27.840
take care of Wuxia.

41:27.920 --> 41:29.160
Please rest assured, Chancellor.

41:29.240 --> 41:30.600
I'll stay vigilant at all times.

41:32.760 --> 41:33.880
(Taohua, don't worry.)

41:34.240 --> 41:35.600
(I'll bring back the cure myself)

41:36.000 --> 41:37.120
(from Beiyuan.)

41:54.040 --> 41:57.240
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

41:57.320 --> 42:00.360
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

42:01.280 --> 42:04.400
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

42:04.520 --> 42:08.280
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

42:08.560 --> 42:11.640
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

42:11.760 --> 42:15.080
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

42:15.480 --> 42:19.040
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

42:19.120 --> 42:24.840
♪With no one it can be brought♪

42:29.800 --> 42:36.720
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

42:37.160 --> 42:44.000
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

42:44.480 --> 42:51.480
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

42:51.800 --> 42:55.840
♪Even if it means this flower♪

42:55.960 --> 43:02.920
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

43:14.040 --> 43:17.160
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

43:17.240 --> 43:20.480
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

43:20.840 --> 43:24.520
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

43:24.640 --> 43:31.200
♪No longer needing to say♪

43:35.280 --> 43:42.200
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

43:42.600 --> 43:49.560
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

43:49.920 --> 43:56.920
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

43:57.280 --> 43:58.960
♪And finding♪

43:59.040 --> 44:06.040
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
